@shatyuka/dsh-llm-codebuddy README · dsh-llm-codebuddy：**English** | [中文](README.zh.md)

A [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) (`dsh`) plugin for **Tencent CodeBuddy**.

Sign in through your browser — **no API key required** — and use CodeBuddy's own model list.

@shatyuka/dsh-llm-codebuddy README · Sign in：The two sites are the same service on different hosts but hold **separate accounts** — one site's account does not work on the other — so the site is chosen per sign-in and recorded with the credential. Every later request goes to the host that issued it. To move to the other site, sign out and sign in again.

Alternatively, sign in from the terminal:

```bash

@shatyuka/dsh-llm-codebuddy README · Remove the stored credential：dsh plugin --profile web exec dsh-codebuddy-login --logout
```

Once signed in, CodeBuddy's models appear in the model picker.

@shatyuka/dsh-llm-codebuddy README · Test：```bash
pnpm test
```
